  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ateek Ahmad vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Food ... on 1 April, 2024 Author: Sangeeta Chandra Bench: Sangeeta Chandra High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:26714-Db Court No. - 3 Case :- Writ - C No. - 2879 of 2024 Petitioner :- Ateek Ahmad Respondent :- State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Food Safety And Drug Administration Lko. A Counsel for Petitioner :- Rohitash Kumar Singh Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C.,Ram Kumar Singh Hon'ble Mrs. Sangeeta Chandra,J. Hon'ble Brij Raj Singh,J. 1.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "The petitioner has applied for license for doing the same business, but this license has not been issued despite his application having been made in January, 2023. 4. Sri Ram Kumar Singh, learned counsel for the opposite parties no.2 and 3, on the basis of instructions, says that the petitioner should apply online for grant of such license, he has not done so and therefore his application made on plain piece of paper cannot be considered."
  },
